/bin/
/cartographer
/demo-kb/
*.sqlite
*.db
.DS_Store
migrated-kb/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/rules/
.kiro/*
!.kiro/skills/
# Per-client MCP configuration is machine-local, as CONTRIBUTING.md says: written
# by `cartographer connect`, never committed.
.mcp.json
.codex/config.toml
opencode.json
# Everything under .agents/ other than skills/ is machine-local client state,
# not ours to track: .agents/skills is the canonical, versioned source for the
# repository's own skills (the path Codex documents for repository-local
# skills), and nothing else in there belongs in a commit.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
# Isolated worktrees for plan branches (see `make worktree-add`): never tracked.
/.worktrees/
/data/kb/
!/data/kb/.gitkeep
.env
age-key.txt
.vscode/
graphify-out/
dist/
# The Atlas UI's production bundle is the one generated artifact this
# repository tracks on purpose (D227): `go install` cannot run an npm build, so
# the binary has to carry it. internal/webui's provenance test fails when it is
# stale, and `make web` regenerates it.
!internal/webui/dist/
